[D Quests for Stratholme Undead\\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 59-60 Stratholme Undead]
[NX 60 20man Ruins of Ahn Qiraj]

Stratholme Undead is the east half of Stratholme in the north of the Eastern Plaguelands. Its door is the service gate on the city's east side, not the main gate on the west side that leads to Stratholme Living.
-- Left out: 5122 The Medallion of Faith, 5212 The Flesh Does Not Lie, 5243 Houses of the Holy, 5214 The Great Ezra Grimm, 5251 and 5262 (Archivist, Balnazzar), 5848 Of Love and Family: their objectives are on the Living side (Dungeon Journal files them under Stratholme: Living); the Stratholme Living guide carries them. 5125, 5213 and 5263 below only show up once you finished 5122, 5212 or 5262.
-- Left out: 5461 to 5465 (Ras Frostwhisper's Keepsake chain): only 5463 touches Stratholme; the chain is a round trip from Caer Darrow to Stromgarde in the Arathi Highlands and back, and it ends at 5466 in Scholomance. No guide carries it yet.
-- Left out: 8945 Dead Man's Plea and the rest of the Anthion chain (8946 onward), 8968 and 8991 (Valthalak amulet pieces): the dungeon-set upgrade chains start in Orgrimmar, Ironforge or Blackrock Mountain and only pass through Stratholme for one fight.

-- Horde: Undercity, then the Scholomance guide's road to the Eastern Plaguelands and Nathanos Blightcaller.
[A Horde] Start in Undercity. At Michael Garrett, get the Undercity flight path [P Undercity] [G63.1,48.3 Undercity]
[A Horde] Lady Sylvanas Windrunner gives [QA5961 The Champion of the Banshee Queen] [G58.0,91.8 Undercity] \\ Needs level 54. Nathanos's chain needs it.
[A Horde] Leave Undercity by the main lift [G56.8,17.2 Undercity][G61.8,65.0 Tirisfal Glades] [OC]
[A Horde] East along the road past the Bulwark [G69.8,64.9 Tirisfal Glades][G80.4,64.9 Tirisfal Glades][G83.1,68.9 Tirisfal Glades] [OC] \\ Scourge mobs of level 50-55 wander the road near the Bulwark.
[A Horde] East to Darrowmere Lake [G26.5,56.0 Western Plaguelands][G34.9,56.5 Western Plaguelands][G46.0,56.6 Western Plaguelands][G46.0,60.8 Western Plaguelands][G47.9,65.0 Western Plaguelands][G48.7,72.0 Western Plaguelands][G53.5,76.5 Western Plaguelands][G58.0,82.5 Western Plaguelands][G61.5,83.4 Western Plaguelands][G62.4,83.4 Western Plaguelands][G65.5,84.6 Western Plaguelands][G67.9,85.6 Western Plaguelands] [OC] \\ Andorhal's undead (level 50-56) and Araj the Summoner (61, elite), Flesh Golems (56-57, elite), Putridius (58, elite) and Skeletal Warlords (56-57, elite) are close to the road; keep to its east edge. Lord Maldazzar (56, elite) roams near 54.2,80.4.

-- Alliance: Chillwind Camp, then the Scholomance guide's road to the Eastern Plaguelands.
[A Alliance] Start at Chillwind Camp. At Bibilfaz Featherwhistle, get the Chillwind Camp flight path [P Chillwind Camp] [G42.9,85.0 Western Plaguelands]
[A Alliance] East along the south shore to Darrowmere Lake [G42.9,85.1 Western Plaguelands][G51.3,84.3 Western Plaguelands][G56.9,83.7 Western Plaguelands][G62.4,83.4 Western Plaguelands][G65.5,84.6 Western Plaguelands][G67.9,85.6 Western Plaguelands] [OC] \\ Lord Maldazzar (56, elite) roams near 54.2,80.4.

-- Both: into the Eastern Plaguelands.
East past the lake's south end into the Eastern Plaguelands [G71.6,85.3 Western Plaguelands][G77.2,83.6 Western Plaguelands][G82.6,75.5 Western Plaguelands][G86.3,67.1 Western Plaguelands][G24.1,78.4 Eastern Plaguelands][G29.9,73.9 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC] \\ Plaguehound packs and Scourge (level 53-58) all along the road.
[A Horde] North-west up to Marris Stead [G22.2,63.5 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC]
[A Horde] Nathanos Blightcaller takes [QT5961 The Champion of the Banshee Queen] and gives [QA6022 To Kill With Purpose] [QA6042 Un-Life's Little Annoyances] [QA6133 The Ranger Lord's Behest] [G22.2,63.5 Eastern Plaguelands] \\ Nathanos is level 62. Duggan Wildhammer (55, elite, Alliance-friendly) stands just south-east.
[A Horde] Back to the road and east to Corin's Crossing [G29.9,73.9 Eastern Plaguelands][G41.0,73.9 Eastern Plaguelands][G46.6,71.9 Eastern Plaguelands][G52.2,65.0 Eastern Plaguelands][G52.6,58.9 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC]
[A Horde] Kill Scourge in Corin's Crossing and grind 7 Living Rot within the time limit [QC6022 To Kill With Purpose] [G52.6,58.9 Eastern Plaguelands] \\ The spot is the middle of Hate Shrieker, Gibbering Ghoul and Dark Caster spawns in QuestieDB (the mobs that drop the rot), not a sourced quest spot. Elite Stitched Horrors (58) walk the town.
[A Alliance] On east along the road toward Light's Hope Chapel [G41.0,73.9 Eastern Plaguelands][G46.6,71.9 Eastern Plaguelands][G52.2,65.0 Eastern Plaguelands][G60.5,65.0 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC]
