Kill Noxious Plaguebats around Light's Hope Chapel [QC6042,1 Un-Life's Little Annoyances][A Horde] [O]
North-east to Light's Hope Chapel [G66.1,58.0 Eastern Plaguelands][G71.7,49.6 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC] \\ Elite Fallen Heroes (58-59) walk near the chapel.
[A Alliance] At Khaelyn Steelwing, get the Light's Hope Chapel flight path [P Light's Hope Chapel] [G71.7,49.6 Eastern Plaguelands]
[A Horde] At Georgia, get the Light's Hope Chapel flight path [P Light's Hope Chapel] [G70.4,47.6 Eastern Plaguelands]
Caretaker Alen gives [QA5281 The Restless Souls] [G69.9,53.7 Eastern Plaguelands] \\ Optional lead-in to 5282 (Dungeon Journal).
Only if you finished The Flesh Does Not Lie (Stratholme Living guide): Betina Bigglezink gives [QA5213 The Active Agent] [G71.7,49.9 Eastern Plaguelands]
Only if you finished The Truth Comes Crashing Down (Stratholme Living guide): Duke Nicholas Zverenhoff gives [QA5263 Above and Beyond] [G71.6,50.1 Eastern Plaguelands]

