[A Horde] North to Quel'Lithien Lodge, take the Quel'Thalas Registry and kill the Woodsmen, Rangers and Pathstriders [QC6133 The Ranger Lord's Behest] [G45.3,12.7 Eastern Plaguelands] \\ The lodge's rangers are level 58-60, and Ranger Lord Hawkspear (60, elite) stands there.
[A Horde] Back down to the road [G44.0,19.0 Eastern Plaguelands] [OC]
