-- Inside. The service gate opens into the Undead side.
Through the service gate on the city's east side into Stratholme Undead [G44.0,19.0 Eastern Plaguelands]
Free 15 restless souls: blast the Ghostly and Spectral Citizens, then blast the freed souls [QC5282 The Restless Souls]
Search the three ziggurats for a box of Scourge Data [QC5213 The Active Agent] \\ It spawns in one of them.
Kill Ramstein the Gorger and take his head [QC6163 Ramstein][A Horde]
Only if you gave Aurius the Medallion of Faith (Stratholme Living guide): talk to Aurius after the Baron fight, he takes and gives [QA5125 Aurius' Reckoning] [QT5125 Aurius' Reckoning]
Kill Baron Rivendare and take his head [QC5263 Above and Beyond]

